WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.720
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an American science fiction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:15.920
comedy family film called “Honey, I Blew&nbsp;
Up the Kid”. Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:24.480
The movie centers around a family of five,&nbsp;
the Szalinski family. The father, Wayne, is an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:29.680
inventor who invents household things that helps&nbsp;
his family work efficiently. In the opening scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:35.440
we see an automated mailbox that receives the&nbsp;
daily newspaper. The family dog runs to the box&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:40.720
every morning and picks a bone attached to it.&nbsp;
Because of it, the newspaper drops below and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.840
brings it back to his master. Even the neighbors&nbsp;
are amazed by the innovation. Other than that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.960
Wayne has made a helmet for himself that helps&nbsp;
him shave, a sound system that helps his wife&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:55.760
call the children when breakfast is ready,&nbsp;
and many other inventions similar to them. 
&nbsp;

00:00:55.760 --> 00:01:01.440
One day, Wayne’s wife Diane is flying to&nbsp;
another state to see off her eldest daughter Amy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:06.240
to college. She will be gone for a few days&nbsp;
and wants her husband to take good care of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:12.640
their middle child, Nick, and the youngest Adam.&nbsp;
After she leaves, Wayne rushes to his job and is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:18.880
late as usual. He works at Sterling Labs of&nbsp;
innovation. His project partner Dr. Charles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:24.080
is not fond of Wayne because he is better than&nbsp;
him. Hence, the doctor tries to exclude Wayne&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:29.280
from the experiments as much as possible. A few&nbsp;
years ago, Wayne developed a prototype that could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:35.520
shrink people and objects into a minuscule size.&nbsp;
Currently, the lab is trying to develop a device&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.720
that does the opposite. Dr. Charles tests the&nbsp;
prototype by using it on a crystal. At first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:46.640
the crystal grows as expected, but right when the&nbsp;
team thinks the experiment worked, it wiggles and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:51.840
explodes all over Dr. Charles’s face. 
He is disappointed, to say the least. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:57.440
is being pressured by the company’s president and&nbsp;
the US government to complete the prototype soon.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:03.600
Wayne has innovative ideas that could help them&nbsp;
but Dr. Charles refuses to listen to him. At home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:09.600
chaos ensues because of Diane's absence. The guys&nbsp;
burn food in the microwave every time they use it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:14.640
Diane calls them and asks them to heat the chicken&nbsp;
that she made before leaving. With burnt chicken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:19.840
in front of him, Wayne lies to her that it tastes&nbsp;
delicious. At last, they have to settle with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.560
peanut butter and toast for dinner. 
After that, Wayne tucks Adam to sleep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:29.920
and sings him a lullaby along with his favorite&nbsp;
toy big bunny. While he is at it, he suddenly gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:35.680
the idea of why the crystal exploded that day at&nbsp;
work. He calls Dr. Charles and explains his theory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:41.280
but the man dismisses him. He thinks that Wayne is&nbsp;
an idiot, incapable of such advanced inventions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.920
The following day is the weekend but Wayne comes&nbsp;
to work along with his kids. He has planned to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:51.600
make the required changes in the prototype without&nbsp;
informing Dr. Charles. The lab guard sees him go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:57.200
inside without registering his name and calls&nbsp;
Dr. Charles to inform him. In the meantime, Wayne&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:03.280
fixes the problem and decides to use the prototype&nbsp;
on Adam’s toy, Big Bunny. As the countdown starts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.640
Adam goes to the platform to get his toy and is&nbsp;
hit with the light wave coming from the prototype.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:14.400
When everything goes silent, Wayne sees that his&nbsp;
idea didn’t work and returns home with the kids,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:18.800
unaware that his son was blasted with&nbsp;
a ray of radiation. As they leave,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:22.720
the guard comments that Adam has grown&nbsp;
bigger, but no one thinks much of it.
&nbsp;

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:33.360
On their way back home, Nick asks Wayne why he&nbsp;
needs Dr. Charles’s permission to work on his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:39.120
own invention. It turns out the idea and initial&nbsp;
plan was Wayne’s but since his partner Dr. Charles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:45.360
doesn’t like him, he has taken over the project.&nbsp;
At home, Wayne calls Nick’s crush Mandy to come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:50.480
and babysit Adam. He and Nick want to go out to&nbsp;
the movies for father-son time. When Adam is alone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:55.600
in the kitchen, he is exposed to electrical waves&nbsp;
from the microwave oven. This causes him to grow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:00.640
over seven feet tall because of the radiation he&nbsp;
received earlier. When his father and brother see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.200
him, they are beyond surprised. They soon&nbsp;
realize that Adam was exposed to radiation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:10.160
from the prototype. They immediately decide&nbsp;
to return to the lab and reverse the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:15.440
To avoid walking in with a seven feet baby,&nbsp;
they disguise Adam to the best of his abilities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.560
However, they are stopped by Dr. Charles who&nbsp;
kicks Wayne out of the project. It turns out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:25.360
that because of the experiment Wayne had conducted&nbsp;
earlier, a power surge occurred which deleted all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:30.080
the information about the experiment. 
Disheartened, Wayne returns home, hoping to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:35.360
get Adam back to normal before Diane gets back.&nbsp;
But his plan fails when he sees her waiting for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:41.120
them with Big Bunny who has grown big like Adam.&nbsp;
At first, they try to run away so she won’t see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:46.320
the grown baby. But knowing that they cannot&nbsp;
hide for long, Wayne comes clean to his wife.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:50.880
When she gets a look at Adam, she passes&nbsp;
out in shock. As Wayne wakes her up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:56.160
Nick tries to get Adam to sit down. The baby plays&nbsp;
around and destroys half the things in the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:01.120
When he is locked in his room, he opens the&nbsp;
entire door and brings it outside. By now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:05.520
the neighbors have gathered outside Szalinski's&nbsp;
residence because of all the noise. After running&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:10.400
around for almost an hour trying to catch him,&nbsp;
they finally calm him down and put him into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:15.360
bigger playpen. Wayne gets a chance to think of&nbsp;
the reason the kid grew when he was brought home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:20.160
and not when he was hit with radiation. Although&nbsp;
he doesn’t get the answers, he remembers that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:25.840
old prototype could shrink people down. The device&nbsp;
is currently stored in the Sterling warehouse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:30.880
If they can bring it back, there is a chance&nbsp;
Adam will be brought back to his normal size. 
&nbsp;

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:35.920
Wayne then makes Adam take a nap. He and&nbsp;
Diane go to retrieve the first prototype&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:40.800
while Nick takes the responsibility to keep&nbsp;
an eye on Adam. After the parents leave,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:47.040
Mandy arrives at the house to babysit. Nick tries&nbsp;
sending her away but she sees Adam and freaks out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:52.720
With no way out, he ties her to a chair and gags&nbsp;
her so she wouldn’t run away or tell anyone. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:58.240
the meantime, the parents arrive at the warehouse&nbsp;
that has hundreds of crates. They look around and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:02.880
finally find the prototype they are looking&nbsp;
for. Back in the house, Nick tries explaining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:08.160
everything to Mandy. Adam is watching the TV&nbsp;
in the other room. The radiation from the TV&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:14.080
makes him get even taller. He runs away from the&nbsp;
house. Nick and Mandy run outside to look for him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:18.800
while Adam wreaks havoc in the neighborhood. He is&nbsp;
sitting in the middle of the street with his bunny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:24.240
while a crowd watches. Dr. Chrales also sees&nbsp;
this and realizes why Wayne was in the lab&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:29.520
on the weekend. Wayne and Diane are on their way&nbsp;
back home. Diane is driving while Wayne is fixing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:34.160
his old prototype in the back of the car. 
They are followed by two policemen for speeding.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:43.440
Wayne uses the prototype on them and shrinks the&nbsp;
two. Before escaping, he turns them back to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:50.320
normal size, leaving them amazed. Dr. Charles&nbsp;
takes the responsibility to handle the situation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:55.360
with Adam. He wants to use the chaos that Adam&nbsp;
has caused to drive the president against Wayne.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.360 --> 00:07:00.480
He has already sent Adam to the lab to get tested&nbsp;
when his parents return. On their way to the lab,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:05.840
Adam gets struck with a bigger wave of radiation&nbsp;
because of the electric cables. This grows his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:11.040
size even more and he escapes from the van.&nbsp;
The president of Sterling lab, Clifford,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:15.520
finally arrives at the Szalinski residence. Dr.&nbsp;
Chrales tells him that everything was Wayne’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:19.920
fault but the president is impressed by Wayne&nbsp;
for doing what the other scientists couldn’t.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:25.440
He fires Dr. Charles for not being a team worker&nbsp;
and helps Wayne. A policeman informs them of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:31.360
Adam’s escape and they run to save him. Meanwhile,&nbsp;
Dr. Charles calls a board member of Sterling's lab&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:36.640
named Terence who agrees to help him get his&nbsp;
position back. On their way to get Adam, Clifford&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:42.560
and Wayne come to realize that he is growing in&nbsp;
size because of electromagnetic flux. Since Adam&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.520
is making his way to Las Vegas, he is going to&nbsp;
grow even bigger because of the neon signs. 
&nbsp;

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:51.360
Dr. Charles meets Terence who brings&nbsp;
him back to the team using his authority&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:55.760
as the board member. Dr. Charles wants&nbsp;
to use the military to stop the havoc.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:59.920
Everyone finally makes it to the highway that&nbsp;
Adam is on. They are shocked to see that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:05.600
grown into a giant. For the shrinking prototype to&nbsp;
work, the kid has to hold still for twelve seconds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:11.120
which the parents think is impossible. He comes&nbsp;
closer to them, revealing that Nick and Mandy are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:16.960
inside his pockets. Just then, Wayne comes up with&nbsp;
an idea. He calls the police to bring Big Bunny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:22.640
to Adam. A helicopter brings the toy to the kid&nbsp;
as Wayne sings a lullaby. The plan works and Adam&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:28.560
is about to sleep when Wayne mentions he has to&nbsp;
take a nap. Adam, who always hated the word nap,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:34.720
refuses to sleep after that. Then, he walks to&nbsp;
Las Vegas, threatening to destroy everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:40.000
on his way. Somewhere else, Dr. Charles gets&nbsp;
ready with a tranquilizer gun and a helicopter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:45.280
to sedate the kid, even though it means severe&nbsp;
health risks. Adam finally reaches the city and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:49.760
starts running around the streets. A crowd of&nbsp;
people gathers to see him, some of them running&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:55.360
away to save their lives. The street lights and&nbsp;
signs amuse him, making him even more frantic. 
&nbsp;

00:08:55.360 --> 00:09:01.120
When he bends down, Mandy and Nick manage to climb&nbsp;
down to a yellow car. But Adam picks it up and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:06.560
swings it in the air to play with it. He places&nbsp;
them on a billboard where they hang dangerously.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:11.600
As the crowd watches, holding its breath,&nbsp;
he finally puts the car inside his pockets,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:16.480
not harming his brother and Mandy in any way.&nbsp;
Following that, Wayne gets another one of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:21.040
great ideas. He knows that Adam likes ice&nbsp;
cream more than anything in his life. Hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:26.080
he plans to lure him into a secluded highway&nbsp;
using an ice cream truck. The plan works and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:30.640
Adam chases behind the truck. However, he&nbsp;
closes on it quickly and the driver has to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:36.160
stop to save his life. Then, Dr. Charles arrives&nbsp;
at the scene on a helicopter with a tranquilizer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:40.960
gun. He misses the first shot while the second&nbsp;
one lands on a guitar the kid is holding.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:47.040
It hurts Adam and he begins to cry. At last,&nbsp;
Diane volunteers to be shot by the prototype&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:51.920
so she can be bigger than Adam and can hold&nbsp;
him down. After being hit by the radiation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:58.000
she grows even taller than the skyscrapers.&nbsp;
Adam sees her and stops crying. As the two hug,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:03.200
Wayne shoots them with his first prototype and&nbsp;
turns them back into their normal sizes. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:08.720
everything calms down, Diane punches Dr. Charles&nbsp;
in the face for trying to hurt her son.
&nbsp;

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.400
All of a sudden, they remember that&nbsp;
Nick and Mandy were in Adam’s pocket.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:16.960
Meaning that they might have turned minuscule&nbsp;
because of the prototype. They use their dog to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:22.640
look for them. It turns out that they are stuck in&nbsp;
a tiny car. Mandy compliments Nick saying that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:28.080
is different from most guys she meets. She leans&nbsp;
on his shoulders, making him blush. Wayne soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:32.720
finds him and the story ends happily. 
